start SalesAgent

  when a message comes in:
    read the task_type from the message
    
    if task_type is QUALIFY_LEAD:
      score the lead based on deal size and fit
      save to CRM database
      return score to CEO
      
    if task_type is GENERATE_PITCH:
      take the lead info and product details
      call the LLM to write a personalized message
      return the pitch
      
    if task_type is LOG_REVENUE:
      save the closed deal to the database
      send the revenue amount over to Finance agent
      
    if task_type is PIPELINE_REPORT:
      pull all active deals from the database
      count leads, demos, closed deals
      calculate projected revenue
      send summary to CEO

    if task_type is ESCALATE_DISCOUNT:
      check if discount is above allowed threshold
        if yes, forward to CEO for approval

  when sending a message:
    wrap the result in the standard JSON envelope
    set status to "done"
    send it to the right agent
